 .. versionadded:: 2.10
    The ``trimmed`` and ``notrimmed`` modifiers have been added.
 
+Translation variable safety
+~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
+
+Names declared in a ``trans`` header or referenced by its body must be
+Python identifiers and must not shadow ``gettext``, ``ngettext``,
+``pgettext``, ``npgettext``, or ``_``. Assigned values may use
+constants, names, attributes, filters, tests, and calls to simple
+function names.
+Item access, arithmetic, conditional expressions, method calls, and
+dynamic ``*args`` or ``**kwargs`` are rejected when the template is
+compiled. This keeps translation placeholders independent from arbitrary
+template data operations.
+
 It's possible to translate strings in expressions with these functions:
 
 -   ``gettext``: translate a single string
